#!/bin/bash
# Toggle the DP monitor pin (see pin-monitors). To switch the LG's dual mode:
# press once (unpin), switch the mode on the monitor, press again (pin the new EDID).
if systemctl is-active -q pin-monitors; then
  sudo -n systemctl stop pin-monitors && notify-send 'Monitor unpinned' 'Switch the dual mode, then press again to re-pin'
else
  sudo -n systemctl start pin-monitors && notify-send 'Monitor pinned'
fi || notify-send -u critical 'pin-monitors toggle failed'
